_:N00e99d6a9d8c401fb88ecec8914d471e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipertestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità referente. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypertextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the referring entity. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@en .
